### Get selected analysis
GET https://localhost:8443/api/list/5599/selectedAnalyses
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### set ALERTS analysis as selected
POST https://localhost:8443/api/list/5407/selectedAnalyses
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "analysisIds": ["ALERTS"]
}

### set FCD analysis as selected
POST https://localhost:8443/api/list/5442/selectedAnalyses
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
{
  "analysisIds": ["FCD"]
}
